afyi|n|A kind of knot often used at the end of a rope; a wall knot; a wale. ; A work or structure of stone, brick, or other materials, raised to some height, and intended for defense or security, solid and permanent inclosing fence, as around a field, a park, a town, etc., also, one of the upright inclosing parts of a building or a room. ; A defense; a rampart; a means of protection; in the plural, fortifications, in general; works for defense. ; An inclosing part of a receptacle or vessel; as, the walls of a steam-engine cylinder. ; The side of a level or drift. ; The country rock bounding a vein laterally.	a:t4h,115,2;z6u,99,13;7evi,95,304;2exv,95,14;2ey0,94,8;ag0p,82,3;4btj,80,28;8mn6,80,3;ney,74,4;4dct,72,63;5yix,71,6;5ldd,70,4;3jiq,70,43;fnp,68,8;a498,68,2~6s6x,26,1084;1qvr,45,978;4ke0,56,881;34dh,65,800;2x82,21,700;abfv,36,570;8pm3,3,566;3fvn,45,541;8u0v,29,496;aj94,21,481;wyo,9,408;ajfk,5,405;4hyq,16,371;2m07,7,364;9lm9,39,335	v:t4h,105,1;291a,102,13;5bt4,101,18;8lmh,98,6;805e,84,1686;afoc,81,46;2o5b,73,6;38lm,71,2;tt2,71,1495;6uvw,66,4;7oyd,64,1;6v84,63,4;76h7,61,13;a9ro,60,8;95xg,60,20~805e,84,1686;tt2,71,1495;333o,20,666;353i,26,445;3ast,23,266;1kq5,55,206;6um4,51,201;3g9x,56,155;2o4c,27,153;1s0k,13,129;8l3e,3,125;2ste,33,121;2jhl,26,120;359c,16,118;99z2,23,106	V:4wf3,94,9;6vje,75,4;aggf,73,52;agg2,64,53;3rnj,64,9;885e,64,5;6v8q,62,2;8lix,62,54;6v8e,61,14;32xq,61,112;1jc,60,3;8lit,58,10;9lk6,56,17;12p3,51,22;5zco,51,730~9vq8,1,941;5zco,51,730;7aup,13,239;1x42,31,188;76j5,46,185;8h85,38,147;5p16,34,146;359c,19,142;5zcw,36,124;3gdo,47,116;32xq,61,112;7aor,6,96;9aeb,26,93;7k5f,34,92;37oc,31,83	n:1in2,103,76;3jij,99,11;38lm,97,12;13mk,96,5665;44na,94,8;fas,94,7;6w7d,92,30;2exv,85,7;13s5,81,3;95wr,81,134;a7na,79,18;76h6,77,45;95xd,75,614;2sd0,75,5;76h5,74,333~13mk,96,5665;353i,51,2466;34dh,74,1513;3fqy,54,1045;zid,18,977;8nz8,16,954;sfs,70,745;93jo,54,702;95xd,75,614;6rlu,33,575;1csk,21,564;a6aa,21,526;4izy,3,505;2o4c,44,477;3ugs,8,437	N:agg2,108,1105;aggf,108,